---
// Achievements Grid Component
---

<section class="cv-section">
  <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i> Dominio Global & Reconocimientos</h2>
  <div class="awards-grid">
    <!-- Card 1: HTB Top 1 -->
    <div class="glass-card highlight-card">
      <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i></div>
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Hack The Box</h3>
        <div class="card-subtitle">#1 Ecuador | #43 Mundial</div>
        <p>Plataforma de práctica en pentesting y laboratorios empresariales.</p>
        <img 
          src="/images/about/ranknacional.jpg" 
          alt="Ranking HTB Nacional" 
          class="card-img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Blue Team LatAm -->
    <div class="glass-card blue-card">
      <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Holmes CTF 2025</h3>
        <div class="card-subtitle">Capitán - Mejor Blue Team LatAm</div>
        <p>Competencia de respuesta a incidentes y análisis forense digital.</p>
        <img 
          src="/images/about/ctf-blue.png" 
          alt="Blue Team Win" 
          class="card-img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: LACC -->
    <div class="glass-card">
      <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-flag"></i></div>
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>LACC 2025 - Colombia</h3>
        <div class="card-subtitle">Capitán Equipo Ecuador</div>
        <p>4to Lugar Regional en el Latin American Cybersecurity Challenge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: CyberFlippers Captain -->
    <div class="glass-card purple-card">
      <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Capitán CyberFlippers</h3>
        <div class="card-subtitle">Equipo Nacional Ecuador</div>
        <p>Equipo competitivo enfocado en CTFs internacionales y formación técnica.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .awards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* High Contrast Cards (Replacing Glass) */
  .glass-card {
    background: var(--bg-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: relative;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--border-color);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .glass-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: #111;
  }

  .highlight-card { border-left-color: var(--success-color, #10B981); }
  .blue-card { border-left-color: var(--blue-team); }
  .purple-card { border-left-color: var(--purple-team); }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .highlight-card .card-icon { color: var(--success-color, #10B981); }
  .blue-card .card-icon { color: var(--blue-team); }
  .purple-card .card-icon { color: var(--purple-team); }

  .card-content h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .card-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .card-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    display: block;
  }
</style>
